+## Unreleased
+
+### Added
+
+- Local prototype: `nh os` rebuild commands accept `--flake-source-command`
+  (`NH_OS_FLAKE_SOURCE_COMMAND`) to prepare a flake after input updates and before
+  building. The program receives the selected reference and prints its replacement;
+  nh preserves the selected attributes. Non-flake installables bypass the hook.
+
 ## 4.1.2
 
 ### Added
